cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies
  (preferred-citation) and the tools it is built on where they enter your
  result: the references below name each one. THIRD_PARTY.md records their
  pinned revisions, licences and every local modification.
type: software
title: "grendel-sensitivity: sensitivity of the GRENDEL detector to the PBC benchmark models"
authors:
  - family-names: Citron
    given-names: Matthew
  - family-names: Redi
    given-names: Federico Leo
    affiliation: "Università degli Studi di Bergamo"
    email: federicoleo.redi@unibg.it
  - family-names: Schmitz
    given-names: Ryan
repository-code: "https://github.com/exoticdarksectors/grendel-sensitivity"
license:
  - BSD-3-Clause
  - LGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - long-lived particles
  - heavy neutral leptons
  - dark scalar
  - axion-like particles
  - HL-LHC
  - Physics Beyond Colliders
